# `git archive` ships the library (core/, json/, dsv/, host/), the command line (cmd/stury) with its test assets, the
# examples, the test suites, the tools, the benchmark harness, the docs, the Makefile and the licences. From it
# `make lint test` and `make build-cli` run.
/.github/ export-ignore
# Conformance cases and test vectors are compared byte for byte, so a checkout keeps their line ends as committed.
/toml/test/conformance/** -text
/xml/test/conformance/cases.tsv -text
/yaml/test/suite/** -text
/cbor/test/vectors/** -text
/html/test/conformance/html5lib/** -text
/html/test/conformance/wpt/** -text
# The entity and encoding tables, and the sources whose digests are checked, are read as bytes, so a checkout keeps
# them as committed.
/core/spell/entities/* -text
/html/encodings/encodings.json -text
